	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["2101000000000011"]
			description: [
				"&e&lFirst SU.&r"
				""
				"Create runs on &orotation&r, and rotation is described by two numbers you will see on everything: &fRPM&r and &fSU&r."
				""
				"&e&lSU is a budget, not a battery.&r Stress Units are never stored and never used up. Every generator you place &ladds&r capacity to the network. Every machine you attach &lsubtracts&r from it. While total demand stays under total supply, the whole thing runs forever, free, with no fuel."
				""
				"&cGo one point over and the entire network stops.&r Not slowly. Not the last machine you added. All of it, at once, flashing red. That is the single thing that confuses everyone starting Create - nothing is broken, you have simply spent more stress than you own."
				""
				"&e&lThe fix is always one of two things:&r add another water wheel, or take a machine off the line. Put on the Engineer's Goggles from later in this chapter and you can read your exact budget off any shaft."
				""
				"&e&lThis chapter is the whole basic loop&r - andesite, shafts, a water wheel, a press, a mixer - and it ends at the &ePrecision Mechanism&r."
				""
				"&6That one item is the gate to the rest of the pack.&r The Metallurgic Infuser is built around a Precision Mechanism, and every machine in Mekanism sits behind the Infuser. No kinetics, no tech."
				""
				"&7Contraptions, trains, belts and automation are not here - they live in &fThe Steam Age&7, after this.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:water_wheel"
			id: "44EA000000000001"
			rewards: [{
				id: "44EA000000000101"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7Industry before electricity"
			tasks: [{
				id: "44EA000000000201"
				title: "Feel the rotation"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&2The Kinetic Age"
			x: -8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["44EA000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&eAndesite Alloy&r is the Kinetic Age's iron. Sieve gravel with a flint mesh for &eandesite pebbles&r, craft them into andesite, and alloy it with iron or zinc nuggets."
				""
				"Every shaft, casing and cogwheel starts here. Make a pile."
			]
			icon: "create:andesite_alloy"
			id: "44EA000000000002"
			rewards: [{
				count: 8
				id: "44EA000000000102"
				item: "create:andesite_alloy"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "&7The kinetic iron"
			tasks: [{
				count: 8L
				id: "44EA000000000202"
				item: "create:andesite_alloy"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&2Andesite Alloy"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["44EA000000000002"]
			description: [
				"&eShafts&r carry rotation; &eCogwheels&r turn corners and change speed. This is your wiring now - lay it like you mean it."
				""
				"&e&lThe two numbers that run all of Create.&r"
				"&7- &fSpeed (RPM)&7 - how fast something turns. Machines have minimum speeds; some break above a maximum."
				"&7- &fStress (SU)&7 - how much load the network can carry. Every machine &lcosts&r stress; every generator &lsupplies&r it. Exceed your budget and the whole line stops dead."
				""
				"&e&lGearing changes one at the expense of the other.&r A &7Cogwheel&r next to a &7Large Cogwheel&r halves the speed and doubles the torque; the other way round doubles speed and halves it. You never get both."
				""
				"&c&lThe rule that catches everyone:&r a shaft can only be driven by &lone&r source. Two generators feeding the same line from opposite ends will lock it up and flash red. If a network jams, look for two things fighting over the same shaft."
				""
				"&7Put on the Engineer's Goggles from the next quest and look at any block - it shows the whole network's speed and stress budget live. Do not build blind.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:cogwheel"
			id: "44EA000000000003"
			rewards: [{
				count: 4
				id: "44EA000000000103"
				item: "create:shaft"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Rotation is power"
			tasks: [
				{
					count: 8L
					id: "44EA000000000203"
					item: "create:shaft"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 4L
					id: "44EA000000000213"
					item: "create:cogwheel"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&2Shafts & Cogs"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["44EA000000000003"]
			description: [
				"A &eWater Wheel&r in flowing water makes free, forever torque. Your cobble generator's water was already flowing - now it works a double shift."
				""
				"More wheels, more stress capacity. The Large Water Wheel does the same job with more style."
			]
			icon: "create:water_wheel"
			id: "44EA000000000004"
			rewards: [{
				id: "44EA000000000104"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
