		{
			dependencies: ["44EA000000000006"]
			description: [
				"A &eBasin&r under a &eMechanical Mixer&r combines ingredients automatically - dough, dyes, and soon, alloys. The cauldron of the industrial age."
				""
				"&e&lHow to build it so it actually works:&r"
				"&71.&r Place the Basin."
				"&72.&r Place the Mixer &lexactly two blocks above it&r - one air gap between. Any other spacing and nothing happens."
				"&73.&r Drive the Mixer from the top with a shaft or cog."
				"&74.&r Feed items in from any side with funnels or chutes; fluids via pipes."
				""
				"&e&lGetting the output out&r is the part people miss. A Basin holds its result until something takes it. Put a &7Basin&r facing a belt or chute by right-clicking its lower edge with a Wrench to set the output side - otherwise it fills up and stalls."
				""
				"&e&lHeat matters.&r Some recipes need a &7Blaze Burner&r directly under the Basin, and a few need it &lsuper-heated&r. That is the next quest - and it is what unlocks brass."
				""
				"&7The Mixer is your alloying station: zinc + copper into brass, iron + andesite into more useful things. Everything in Create's mid-tier passes through here.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:mechanical_mixer"
			id: "44EA000000000009"
			rewards: [{
				id: "44EA000000000109"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "&7Stir with torque"
			tasks: [
